<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak Oct jobless dips to 12.01 pct (12.23 pct).</title>
<headline>Slovak Oct jobless dips to 12.01 pct (12.23 pct).</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of jobless in Slovakia in October totalled 308,416, or 12.01 percent of the workforce, down from 12.23 percent in September, the Slovak Ministry of Labour said on Wednesday.</p>
<p> SLOVAK UNEMPLOYMENT RATE     OCT '96    SEPT '96    OCT '95</p>
<p>  Total jobless		   308,416    313,930     325,490</p>
<p>  Percentage of workforce	12.01	12.23	 12.80</p>
<p>--Bratislava Newsroom 42-7-563 3687</p>
